  - "Morghur cannot be harmed by missile attacks or spells unless the model that is the source of the attack is within 12 inches of him. At the beginning of each close-combat round, every enemy model in base contact with Morghur suffers a Strength 3 hit with no armour save allowed."
sourcePage: 97
