  - "All friendly units with Primal Fury within 6 inches immediately move D6+1 inches directly forward, using normal terrain and wheeling rules and stopping 1 inch from other units or impassable terrain. Fleeing units are unaffected. The boosted version extends the radius to 12 inches."
