fullText:
  - "A friendly unit within 18 inches gains Frenzy. If it already has Frenzy, each model instead gains two extra Attacks. At the end of each friendly turn the unit suffers D6 wounds with no armour saves. After it loses a combat, the effect becomes ordinary Frenzy."
sourcePage: 154
